      "spam": false,
      "value": "I really doubt that happening, at least for the foreseeable future. They're first and foremost a company trying to delivery a service. Open-sourcing their code would take away any power they'd have to monetize their system, meaning many tiny vrchats with different names would develop apart from their influence, and that's just not how companies work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
